---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout page="home" title="Connectivity Care Solutions | NDIS disability support in Eleebana, NSW" description="Personalised NDIS disability support in Eleebana, NSW. Support coordination, daily living, community access, respite and more.">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <h1>Care that keeps you connected to the life you love</h1>
        <p class="lede">Personalised NDIS support for young people, older people and people with disability. We work with you and your family to build support around your goals, your routines and your plan.</p>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/contact">Contact us</a>
          <a class="btn btn-outline" href="tel:+61488905457"><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-phone"/></svg>Call +61 488 905 457</a>
        </div>
        <ul class="assurances">
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-shield"/></svg>Registered NDIS provider</li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-pin"/></svg>Based in Eleebana, NSW</li>
          <li><svg class="icon"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Supporting participants since 2022</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="collage">
        <svg class="collage-heart icon-fill" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>
        <figure class="ph c1"><img src="/images/beach_fence.jpg" alt="A smiling man standing by a fence overlooking the beach on a sunny day" style="object-position:50% 35%"></figure>
        <figure class="ph c2"><img src="/images/swing1.jpg" alt="A young woman relaxing on a basket swing at a local park" style="transform:scale(1.9);transform-origin:46% 47%"></figure>
        <figure class="ph c3"><img src="/images/garden_smile.jpg" alt="Planting seedlings in a raised garden bed" style="transform:scale(1.6);transform-origin:84% 45%"></figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <h2>Everyone's support looks different</h2>
      <div>
        <p>Connectivity Care Solutions recognises each person's individuality. We believe there's a personalised care solution for everyone, and we work within the NDIS framework to find it together.</p>
        <p>Our aim is simple: better health outcomes, more comfort, and a life lived with respect and dignity. We're open about how we work, and we take your privacy seriously.</p>
        <p>We're building a community where participants, families and professional carers work toward shared goals, and where everyone is supported to thrive.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Why families choose us</h2>
        <p class="lede">Four things you can count on from your very first conversation.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="reasons">
        <li class="reason">
          <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/roses.jpg" alt="A woman smiling while holding a vase of yellow roses" style="object-position:55% 30%"></figure>
          <h3>Personalised care</h3>
          <p>Every person is different, so every support plan is too. We take the time to understand what you need and what matters to you.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="reason">
          <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/drill.jpg" alt="A woman with a cordless drill and tool belt, ready for jobs around the home" style="object-position:50% 40%"></figure>
          <h3>Experienced team</h3>
          <p>Our dependable team of support professionals brings years of experience across disability and care services.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="reason">
          <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/garden_root.jpg" alt="Pulling out an old root while clearing a backyard garden" style="object-position:40% 50%"></figure>
          <h3>Community focused</h3>
          <p>People thrive when they feel connected. We help you stay involved in the community around you.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="reason">
          <figure class="ph"><img src="/images/swing2.jpg" alt="Swinging at a beachside playground on a sunny afternoon" style="transform:scale(1.35);transform-origin:42% 52%"></figure>
          <h3>Flexible services</h3>
          <p>Your needs can change, and your support should keep up. We shape our services around what's right for you.</p>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section tint">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div>
        <h2>How we can help</h2>
        <p class="lede">From help around the house to getting out in the community, every support is shaped around the person receiving it.</p>
        <div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/services">View all services</a></div>
      </div>
      <ul class="svc-links">
        <li><a href="/services#svc-support-coordination"><svg class="icon icon-fill"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>NDIS Support Coordination</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-daily-living"><svg class="icon icon-fill"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Assistance with daily living</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-independent-living"><svg class="icon icon-fill"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Supported independent living</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-community-access"><svg class="icon icon-fill"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Community access and group activities</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-short-medium-stay"><svg class="icon icon-fill"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Short and medium stay accommodation</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-in-home"><svg class="icon icon-fill"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>In-home services</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-shopping-domestic"><svg class="icon icon-fill"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Shopping and domestic duties</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-appointments"><svg class="icon icon-fill"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Getting to appointments</a></li>
        <li><a href="/services#svc-respite"><svg class="icon icon-fill"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>Respite</a></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <h2>Everyday moments that matter</h2>
        <p class="lede">Beach walks, park days, gardening and coffee catch-ups. This is what support looks like for the people we work with.</p>
      </div>
      <ul class="gallery" tabindex="0" aria-label="Photos from days out in the community">
        <li><figure><div class="ph"><img src="/images/bench.jpg" alt="A man in a cap and sunglasses sitting on a bench by the water" style="object-position:50% 45%"></div><figcaption>Sunny days by the water</figcaption></figure></li>
        <li><figure><div class="ph"><img src="/images/sunset.jpg" alt="A walk along the beach at sunset" style="object-position:60% 60%"></div><figcaption>Beach walks at sunset</figcaption></figure></li>
        <li><figure><div class="ph"><img src="/images/swing1.jpg" alt="Relaxing on a basket swing at the park" style="transform:scale(1.9);transform-origin:46% 47%"></div><figcaption>Afternoons at the park</figcaption></figure></li>
        <li><figure><div class="ph"><img src="/images/garden_bed.jpg" alt="Planting lettuce and seedlings in a covered garden bed" style="object-position:45% 50%"></div><figcaption>Getting the garden growing</figcaption></figure></li>
        <li><figure><div class="ph"><img src="/images/cafe.jpg" alt="A man smiling at an outdoor café table" style="object-position:50% 45%"></div><figcaption>Catching up over coffee</figcaption></figure></li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="cta">
        <svg class="cta-heart icon-fill" viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><use href="#i-heart"/></svg>
        <div>
          <h2>Ready to start your NDIS journey?</h2>
          <p>Get in touch to learn more about our support services and how we can help you reach your goals.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="btn-row">
          <a class="btn btn-light" href="/contact">Contact us</a>
          <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="tel:+61488905457">Call +61 488 905 457</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
